  "summary": "Run once after the options menu at $61A8 in Trush block 4: writes the hooks into Zynaps (28 operand patches, 10 of them with a CALL opcode, 3 NOP sites), copies the driver file to bank 1, the stubs and trampolines to their places, and moves the Mover to $5BCC, which puts Zynaps's $5C00-$73FF in place and jumps to $B200.",
